flowchart TB
    subgraph Local[Local development]
        Env[Ignored .env]
        Python[Python app or local Docker container]
        Source[Source and pinned dependencies]
        Build[Multi-stage Docker build: Linux AMD64]
        Ignore[.dockerignore excludes credentials and local artifacts]
        Config[Non-secret endpoint and model settings]
        Push[Docker push with gcloud credential helper]
        Env -->|load_dotenv| Python
        Source --> Build
        Ignore --> Build
        Build --> Push
        Env -->|Endpoint and model only| Config
    end
    subgraph GCP[Google Cloud: jd-assignment1-599 / us-west1]
        Registry[Artifact Registry: assignment-1]
        Secrets[Secret Manager: versioned NIM key]
        Identity[Dedicated runtime service account]
        subgraph Runtime[Cloud Run: briefly]
            Service[Public service: non-root container]
            App[FastAPI and three MCP subprocesses]
            Temporary[SDK session memory and data files: ephemeral]
            Service -->|PORT supplied by Cloud Run| App
            App --- Temporary
        end
        Registry -->|Immutable image digest| Service
        Identity -->|Secret Accessor on the named secret| Secrets
        Secrets -->|Pinned version becomes OPENAI_API_KEY| Service
    end
    Env -->|Key bytes through stdin| Secrets
    Push --> Registry
    Config -->|Environment variables| Service
    Python <-->|HTTPS| NIM[NVIDIA NIM cloud backend]
    App <-->|HTTPS| NIM
    Service --> URL[Public HTTPS live URL]
